 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid, Mary",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You have found favor with God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will bear a son and call him Jesus",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his kingdom will never end",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How can this be, how can this be",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When I have never known a man",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I am only a girl from Nazareth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How can this be his plan",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing is impossible with God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing is impossible with God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Holy Spirit will come upon you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The power of the Most High will overshadow you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And your cousin Elizabeth in her old age",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is with child, for nothing is too hard",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the servant of the Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
